  "prefLabel": "Acp 705.03 Didactic and Clinical Experiences Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Acp 705.03 Didactic and Clinical Experiences Required. Training programs shall include at least 30 hours of didactic education covering subjects related to acupuncture detoxification and 40 clinical hours under the supervision of a licensed acupuncturist.\n\nSource. #12575, eff 7-20-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/acp100-700.html"
